{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2016-11", "window": 1, "start_date": 1477958400, "end_date": 1478563199, "month_true_total": 125, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:52:59 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "26468739", "author": {"steamid": "76561198118193640", "personaname": "Dimitrius", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/dimmipimentel/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 56, "playtime_forever": 1774, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1724, "last_played": 1440709541, "avatar": "bb0a3f11709d71a6e0982bf085b1ba4e472d6878"}, "language": "english", "review": "\"They shall be my finest warriors, these men who give of themselves to me. \nLike clay I shall mould them and in the furnace of war \nI shall forge them. \nThey shall be of iron will and steely sinew. \nIn great armour I shall clad them and with the mightiest weapons shall they be armed. \nThey will be untouched by plague or disease; no sickness shall blight them. \nThey shall have such tactics, strategies and machines that no foe will best them in battle. \nThey are my bulwark against the Terror. \nThey are the Defenders of Humanity. \nThey are my Space Marines \n...and they shall know no fear.\"", "timestamp_created": 1478488938, "timestamp_updated": 1478488938, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26439943", "author": {"steamid": "76561198013969036", "personaname": "Bacxaber", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bacxaber/", "num_games_owned": 535, "num_reviews": 145, "playtime_forever": 285, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 214, "last_played": 1436572395, "avatar": "dc2bdf1494b1d3afabfc77f79b2ff2be796aca1c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Badly ported.", "timestamp_created": 1478367514, "timestamp_updated": 1533167486, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 6, "weighted_vote_score": "0.395353347063064575", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26432475", "author": {"steamid": "76561198129351893", "personaname": "rafalafchillhill", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198129351893/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 863, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 545, "last_played": 1645511111, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "I had a great time playing this game.  It was very gratifying and I felt pretty badass stomping around and exploding bad guys as an adeptus astartes.  story was surprisingly enjoyable, titus is a pretty cool dude.  looking forward to seeing what comes next! the 40K universe is totally awesome already, and this game delivers; short and sweet, brutal and overall plain old fun.", "timestamp_created": 1478342232, "timestamp_updated": 1478342232, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.537136733531951904", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26426170", "author": {"steamid": "76561198044037765", "personaname": "Dataless", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198044037765/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4393, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3131, "last_played": 1652446660, "avatar": "4e31e9c4120275f5fd8a2b0d995256dae3498293"}, "language": "english", "review": "Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine nailed the theme of the 40k universe, the feel as you play a space marine is perfection: Heavy, Relentless, Bulky and Strong. Mowing down Orks with a bolter has never felt quite as satisfying. its a shame this game didnt do better then it did. But THQ did a fantastic job, If your a 40k fan you'll definitely appreciate the thought and time that went into making this feel like a true to universe game.", "timestamp_created": 1478306558, "timestamp_updated": 1478306558, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26409380", "author": {"steamid": "76561198004001370", "personaname": "satsukiFan02", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/100quintilliondollars/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 83, "playtime_forever": 1363, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1053, "last_played": 1723672636, "avatar": "6cde436b622693e9f92c138e6747a9a6f9fb038a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun but I wish it was longer.\nMultiplayer is good.", "timestamp_created": 1478225860, "timestamp_updated": 1478225860, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.495049476623535156", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}